Error [E3301]: `#Live { … }` is not available on a no-OS target.
  --> tests/ui/live_freestanding_e3301.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     #Live {
    |     ^^^^^^^
 Why: No-OS targets have no OS; only `core`-level APIs are available.
 Fix: Terminal I/O requires an OS terminal device. Select a hosted target or declare an IO.Write provider.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3301
